What the DEC compiler is doing is a legal interpretation of the		
standard. You could achieve the same effect, however, using the 
WHERE construct for masked assignment:

   where(x.ne.0.0)
      y = 1.0/x
   elsewhere
      y = 0.0
   end where

                           Mike Metcalf




