}you avoid this?

    Setuid scripts are a bad idea, don't use them.  We find that setuid-root
    programs generally are doing things that don't need tickets (other than
    the user's), but you can through some grossness acquire them.

}|> >9) telnet is disabled in the standard configuration and it cannot
