What's wrong with a TLZ07? One lesson that mainframe types have learned is
that there are definite advantages to buying all your hardware from one
vendor. If we were, God forbid, to switch to a Sun, we'd buy all the
hardware for that system from Sun. Really cuts down on fingerpointing when
things go wrong.

>I've already said why DEC bites; my
>customers stand to gain, not lose, by going elsewhere, something we
