:How does one get the VT400 to print using F2 or CTRL+F5

  I'll guess you are refering to Digital's VT420-based PCTerm...

  To print using typical VT key sequences, try getting into the VT/PC
  mode, look around in the "keyboard" setup screen, and see if you can
  set the item "F2 = xxx" to "F2 = Print".  (I haven't seen the PCTerm,
  I am basing this on how one performs this function on a standard VT420.)

