I got a patch, patchid ULTV44-004-2, a new if_fza.o, but it did not
help. The intermittent input errors are still there and large
transfers are slower than they need to be.

So some questions:

Is there a fix for this problem ?

Are there some installation using a DECstation or DECsystem with a KN05 CPU
(the 60 MHz Mips R4400 thing) with DEFZA FDDI adapter seeing this or
a similiar problem ?

