:I have this AlphaStation 200 4/100, which came (I guess this is
:the standard configuration) with a PC-style keyboard. I would
:really like to have a vt220 look-a-like keyboard (like the LK401
:on a DEC 3000), if only so I can use my editor without remapping
:half the keyboard... I have asked the DEC field engineer, but he
:has not been able to confirm whether this keyboard is available
:(or not :-( ) on this machine.
