Oberlin's central systems environment includes the following:

*  VAX 6000-620 system running VMS.
*  VAX 6000-420 system running OpenVMS.
*  VAXStation 4000-90 development system running VMS.
*  VAXstation 3100-76 console system.
*  DECstation 2100 usenet news server running Ultrix.
