When using RRIP on CDFS, you get the permissions specified in the rock
ridge extension fields.  It sounds like your disc has some unfortunate
protections for its owner information.

The XCDR routines and programs might help here (they let you map user &
group IDs), but I don't recall if the RRIP implemention I did when
working for DEC applies the XCDR mappings before or after RRIP.  In any
case, I believe the file/directory permissions are still enforced, and
you may be SOL if the files/directories do not have permissions enabled
for some group.

