developer:

"sure we support the OSF/1 operating system on a Alpha."

"sorry, we wrote this on OSF/1, those greyed out features
are not available on FooNIX."

as opposed to:

"well, we support HP, and now SUN because someone ordered a huge
amount of stuff for a Sun platform. how big is your order?"

