[As an aside, I find that statement rather insulting. I don't consider
Digital UNIX, OpenVMS, the POLYCENTER products, the Alpha hardware, and
many other products to be inferior, even allowing for my obvious bias.
Besides, ORACLE VLM on a Turbolaser is inferior? 8-) ]

> The argument that "software is
